  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Shaikh Israr Ahmad Niyaz Ahmad vs The State Of Maharashtra on 16 October, 2023",
    "facts": "This is an application for pre-arrest bail in connection with CR No.204 of 2023, registered with Shrinagar Police Station, Thane, for the offences punishable under Sections 328, 188, 272 and 273 read with Section 34 of Indian Penal Code, 1860 (\"the Penal Code\") and Section 26(2)(i), 3(1)(zz)(iv), 59, 26(2)(iv), 30(2)(a), 27(3)(d) and 27(3)(e) of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006. 3. The applicant apprehends arrest in connection with the aforesaid crime as the co-accused in whose possession the contraband articles - Gutakha Pan masala, has been seized, has named the applicant as the person privy to the offences. 10-ABA2879-2023.DOC 4.",
